        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "legend_0060_friend_e",
      "hash64": "8679644619E256F8",
      "text": "So it seems [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Spicy Herba Mystica[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]’s supposed to\\nboost your metabolism!\\c\\nIt gives your circulation a boost and helps flush\\nout all those toxins...along with a ton of sweat![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
